e": "宋史·巻二百七十五", "source_type": "primary", "author": "脱脱等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d7f52d562d203b2a0ae571237b8530fe83e02856/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-01/sources/library/songshi-275-anshouzhong-family/source.txt", "note": "《宋史》巻二百七十五，段落 songshi-9c6e46fee832-p059214；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "b28718aa-dcbf-596e-b2da-3c6d271bb9d4"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·后周纪五", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d7f52d562d203b2a0ae571237b8530fe83e02856/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-01/sources/library/tongjian-294-959-spring/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》后周纪五，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003492；电子底本待考，分段待核", "id": "a02ac045-90ba-56a9-8fb0-e5bbd0c3d25b"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷十二", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d7f52d562d203b2a0ae571237b8530fe83e02856/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0959/part-01/sources/library/xinwudaishi-12-959/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷十二，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p000381；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "46ccc53b-5a04-5228-9747-031d9ca3c3a8"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·后周纪五", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/f54370d6e0a3987ccd1c9d688e5cca102c2c9112/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0958/part-07/sources/library/tongjian-294-958-959-boundary/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》后周纪五，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003491；电子底本待考，分段待核", "id": "bbb854cf-7d17-5784-a960-67ff708a4337"}, {"title": "旧五代史·卷一百二十三", "source_type": "primary", "author": "薛居正等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/f54370d6e0a3987ccd1c9d688e5cca102c2c9112/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0958/part-07/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-123-anshenqi-conspiracy/source.txt", "note": "《旧五代史》卷一百二十三，段落 jiu-wudaishi-205deb4a7860-p002853；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "b074f916-211f-5b03-bb27-4f1c5a66dd0f"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷六十二", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/f54370d6e0a3987ccd1c9d688e5cca102c2c9112/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0958/part-07/sources/library/xinwudaishi-62-chenjue-qiqiu-purge/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷六十二，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p003156；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "954aa798-b817-5f17-94fa-0554b2fb5776"}, {"title": "旧五代史·卷一百十八", "source_type": "primary", "author": "薛居正等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/f54370d6e0a3987ccd1c9d688e5cca102c2c9112/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-294/year-0958/part-07/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-118-december-958/source.txt", "note": "《旧五代史》卷一百十八，段落 jiu-wudaishi-205deb4a7860-p002793；EPUB电子本，纸本及异文待核", "id": "e42954e0-f40a-5f9e-af16-089f11bf1c33"}]'::jsonb)
